          "html": "<details class=\"prog-add\" id=\"sync\">\n  <summary>Sync</summary>\n  <div class=\"body\">\n    <p class=\"hint\">Keeps a copy of this log in the private GitHub repo <strong>IraAga/workout-companion-data</strong>, and pulls back anything logged on another device. Saving always works offline; uploads catch up when you reconnect.</p>\n    <div id=\"sync-off\">\n      <label for=\"sync-token\">Access token\n        <input type=\"password\" id=\"sync-token\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"github_pat_…\">\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"plan-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn primary\" id=\"sync-connect\">Connect</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"sync-on\" hidden>\n      <p class=\"sync-status\" id=\"sync-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Not synced yet</p>\n      <div class=\"plan-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"sync-now\">Sync now</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn danger\" id=\"sync-disconnect\">Disconnect</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</details>"
